{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o068a","title":"曹操遣刘备朱灵邀袁术","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o068a-account","label":"正文","text":"袁术欲北投袁谭，曹操遣刘备、朱灵邀击，恰逢袁术病死。","evidence":["wudi-e-o068a-q"]},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o014a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"曹操命刘备督朱灵、路招截击欲北就袁绍的袁术，未至而袁术病死。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o014a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0057","role":"拟北行而病死","evidence":["wudi-e-o068a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0163","role":"遣迎","evidence":["wudi-e-o068a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"遣军","evidence":["wudi-e-o068a-q"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"奉命邀击","evidence":["wudi-e-o068a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0164","role":"奉命邀击","evidence":["wudi-e-o068a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0023","role":"从征","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o014a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"下邳","evidence":["wudi-e-o068a-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安四年","year":199,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o068a-q","wudi-q-o061","wudi-q-b-51bced16741add42ff70"],"chronology":"wudi-y199","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o061","basis":"建安四年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,366,"O068a"],"order":167},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o014b","title":"曹操还邺夏侯渊督朱灵路招屯长安破刘雄鸣","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o014b-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"曹操还邺夏侯渊督朱灵路招屯长安破刘雄鸣","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o014b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"留军","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o014b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0278","role":"督军破敌","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o014b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0164","role":"屯军","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o014b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0023","role":"屯军","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o014b-q"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0018","role":"被破","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o014b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":212,"label":"建安十七年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xiahoucao-y212","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xiahoucao-q-o014","basis":"建安十七年"},"evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o014b-q","xiahoucao-q-o014","xiahoucao-q-b-5ddbebda291e48a385a3"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-o014b-q","source_order":[9,60,"O014b"],"order":2142}],"persons":[{"id":"xianzhu-p0023","name":"路招","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o014","xiahoucao-q-o014"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xianzhu-m-o014-xianzhu-p0023","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o014"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-m-o014-xianzhu-p0023","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o014"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o068a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4e5d0e149cee6f7fc779","layer":"original","quote":"袁术自败于陈，稍困〖23〗。袁谭自青州遣迎之〖24〗，术欲从下邳北过；公遣刘备、朱灵要之〖25〗，会术病死。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":365,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-51bced16741add42ff70","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-51bced16741add42ff70","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：建安四年（公元 199）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":369,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-20628d34a709162c77f0","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o061","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-502d4e8c0ed143eaa30d","layer":"original","quote":"四年春二月〖1〗，公还至昌邑〖2〗。张杨将杨丑杀杨〖3〗。眭固又杀丑，以其众属袁绍，屯射犬〖4〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":358,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o014b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-4de8ec3f953562853055","layer":"original","quote":"十七年〖1〗，太祖乃还邺，以渊行护军将军，督朱灵、路招等，屯长安。击破南山贼刘雄〔鸣〕，降其众。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":11,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-b-5ddbebda291e48a385a3","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-5ddbebda291e48a385a3","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十七年：建安十七年（公元 212）。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":63,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3ae2b4b8fe9aea30d935","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o014","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-4de8ec3f953562853055","layer":"original","quote":"与太祖会安定，降杨秋。十七年〖1〗，太祖乃还邺，以渊行护军将军，督朱灵、路招等，屯长安。击破南山贼刘雄〔鸣〕，降其众。围遂、超余党梁兴于鄠〖2〗，拔之，斩兴，封博昌亭侯。马超围凉州刺史韦康于冀〖3〗，渊救康；未到，康败。去冀二百余里，超来逆战。军不利。汧氐反，渊引军还。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":135,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o014a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-9236c229b2cd9315f1e3","layer":"original","quote":"袁术欲经徐州北就袁绍，曹公遣先主督朱灵、路招要击术〖4〗。未至，术病死。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o014","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-9236c229b2cd9315f1e3","layer":"original","quote":"袁术欲经徐州北就袁绍，曹公遣先主督朱灵、路招要击术〖4〗。未至，术病死。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
